        "action": "Ban Plastic Tags on Children\u2019s Clothing",
        "additional_details": "We want the Government to urge retailers to use alternatives such as cotton loops, paper tags or stitched in labels to protect children and reduce environmental harm.",
        "background": "This petition calls for the Government to ban plastic tags on children\u2019s clothing, which we believe create avoidable waste, pose choking risks, and contribute to pollution.",
